# Diploma and naive forecast heuristic

When writing thesis text, chapter plans, or comparing forecast methods, follow [docs/VKR.md](docs/VKR.md) and [docs/HEURISTIC_FIVE_MATCH.md](docs/HEURISTIC_FIVE_MATCH.md). Page layout, headings, tables, figures, formulas, citations, and appendices follow [docs/vkr/oformlenie-tgu.md](docs/vkr/oformlenie-tgu.md) (TSU methodological guidelines, 2024). The main text uses chapters, so the contents element is «Оглавление».

- Title: desktop statistical 1X2 app, not a betting shop.
- LLM never picks the winner; it only explains computed probabilities.
- Chapter 3.3 must include historical quality (Brier / log-loss / 1X2 matrix), not only pytest.
- SQLite is a TTL cache, not an enterprise database.
- The «last 5 matches, mean goals, ceil home / floor away» rule is a naive baseline only. Do not replace `Predictor` (Elo + Poisson blend) with it.
- UI disclaimer stays: statistical forecast, not betting advice.
